questions.q:
Given this CSS, what border-left color would a card with `state-complete` receive?

```css
.request-card { border-left: 4px solid #ccc; }
.request-card.state-open     { border-left-color: #2e86de; }
.request-card.state-wip      { border-left-color: #f0a500; }
.request-card.state-complete { border-left-color: #2ecc71; }
```
